+|{set:cellbgcolor:#FFFFFF} `eid`  |31:16      |R      |DC         |Indicates the index pointing to the entry that catches the violation. If no entry is hit, that is, `ERR_INFO.etype`=0x05, 0x06 or 0x07, the value of this field is invalid. If the field is not implemented, it should be wired to 0xffff.
